## 2. Pavé Settings — Band Diamonds Add Sparkle

![Princess Cut Engagement Ring Settings — Budget Guide Under $600](/images/princess-cut-engagement-ring-settings-budget-guide.jpg)

Pavé settings line the band with small diamonds, adding sparkle context for the center stone. The center corners remain exposed — V-prong protection still required.

Pavé adds between 1/10 and 3/8 total carat weight to the ring.

**[Petite Micropavé in 14k White Gold (1/10 ct. tw.) — $1,325](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/petite-micropave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-1-10-ct-tw-item-195402?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)**
Fine micro-bead pavé, barely-there effect. Adds 0.10ct to visual total.

**[Riviera Pavé in 14k White Gold (1/6 ct. tw.) — $1,515](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/riviera-pave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-1-6-ct-tw-item-195326?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)**
Shared-prong pavé, 390 reviews. Most popular pavé band for princess cut.

**[Riviera Pavé in 14k White Gold (5/8 ct. tw.) — $2,855](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/riviera-pave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-5-8-ct-tw-item-195064?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)**
Same Riviera style at maximum pavé weight. Adds 0.625ct of side diamonds.

**[French Pavé in Platinum (1/4 ct. tw.) — $2,140](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/french-pave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-1-4-ct-tw-item-195271?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)**
