**[French Pavé in Platinum (1 ct. tw.) — $3,925](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/french-pave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-1-ct-tw-item-194406?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)**
