**[Scalloped Pavé in Platinum (3/8 ct. tw.) — $2,450](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/scalloped-pave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-3-8-ct-tw-item-194550?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)**
