**[Hand-Engraved Micropavé in Platinum (1/6 ct. tw.) — $2,315](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/hand-engraved-micropave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-1-6-ct-tw-item-194236?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)**
